  "headline": "Soap growth curve: decisions, consequences, and transformation",
  "description": "Tracking Soap’s decisions and costs to understand transformation over time.",
  "articleBody": "Soap is a forward-driving force in Call of Duty. The point of analysis is not trivia, but repeated choices under pressure.\n\nThis piece stays evergreen: it focuses on patterns in depiction rather than time-sensitive plot claims.\n\n1. Baseline: name the initial lack, wound, or constraint.\n\n2. Decisions: track the turning points and what was traded away.\n\n3. Residue: what doesn’t change is often what makes the character feel real.",
